    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225090/extras/e59812d41ac0c5760456f32a48a40c05.avif?t=1754692099\" /></div>Survive in a foreign world using your creativity to assemble your defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225090/extras/aab3b43f74069cdbf9dc0f4c29c74e9c.avif?t=1754692099\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Risk reward - leave your base to acquire resources but run the risk of it being destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use an intuitive building system to employ creative solutions as the enemy threat increases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225090/extras/fd22a8997286cfe30b00c20ea64912f2.avif?t=1754692099\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a variety of weapons, abilities, and upgrades to help you take out waves of enemies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Version Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Friend leaderboard - compete with friends to see who can survive the longest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam cloud saves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225090/extras/e59812d41ac0c5760456f32a48a40c05.avif?t=1754692099\" /></div>Survive in a foreign world using your creativity to assemble your defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225090/extras/aab3b43f74069cdbf9dc0f4c29c74e9c.avif?t=1754692099\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Risk reward - leave your base to acquire resources but run the risk of it being destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use an intuitive building system to employ creative solutions as the enemy threat increases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225090/extras/fd22a8997286cfe30b00c20ea64912f2.avif?t=1754692099\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a variety of weapons, abilities, and upgrades to help you take out waves of enemies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Version Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Friend leaderboard - compete with friends to see who can survive the longest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam cloud saves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
